Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.58,Leg,,0,0,0,,Na aula de hoje,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.22,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai aprender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.00,Leg,,0,0,0,,a fazer o treino HIIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.52,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como é que você faz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,o treino HIIT?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:03.74,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui na bicicleta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:04.37,Leg,,0,0,0,,por exemplo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:04.96,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai colocar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.09,Leg,,0,0,0,,uma carga moderada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.80,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra pesada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.53,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai pedalar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:08.01,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:08.87,Leg,,0,0,0,,que você conseguir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:09.71,Leg,,0,0,0,,por, vamos supor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:10.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,15 segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:10.98,Leg,,0,0,0,,Sem parar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.00,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você consegue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.01,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:14.06,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai diminuir o ritmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar 15 segundos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.00,Leg,,0,0,0,,pedalando no ritmo lento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:16.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:17.91,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai pedalar novamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:19.08,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você consegue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:20.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.34,Leg,,0,0,0,,novamente, pedala devagar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:22.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,Respira, dá uma respirada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.47,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.16,Leg,,0,0,0,,acelera de novo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.05,Leg,,0,0,0,,E assim por diante.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.03,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu vou saber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,quanto tempo eu faço isso,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:27.76,Leg,,0,0,0,,quantas vezes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:28.86,Leg,,0,0,0,,Agora eu vou te explicar melhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:29.64,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai precisar instalar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:30.34,Leg,,0,0,0,,esse aplicativo aqui,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:31.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,vem cá que eu vou te mostrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.74,Leg,,0,0,0,,O nome dele é Timer Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:33.56,Leg,,0,0,0,,é um timer aqui, ó,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.85,Leg,,0,0,0,,00:30, verdinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.09,Leg,,0,0,0,,Se você não encontrar ele,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:37.02,Leg,,0,0,0,,você pode mandar mensagem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:37.54,Leg,,0,0,0,,no nosso suporte,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.28,Leg,,0,0,0,,que a gente envia o link.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,Após instalado,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:40.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai abrir ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.00,Leg,,0,0,0,,Agora eu vou te mostrar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:41.92,Leg,,0,0,0,,como que você configura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui em cima tem um reloginho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:44.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai clicar nele
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.28,Leg,,0,0,0,,e vai configurar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,conforme está aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:46.83,Leg,,0,0,0,,Preparar:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.42,Leg,,0,0,0,,vai ser o tempo pra você começar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,Exercício e descanso:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.02,Leg,,0,0,0,,vai ser o tempo do HIIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:51.76,Leg,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te mandar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra você na sua ficha personalizada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:54.52,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui, por exemplo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:55.98,Leg,,0,0,0,,eu botei 15 segundos de tiro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.58,Leg,,0,0,0,,e 15 segundos de descanso,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:58.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,num total de 10 rodadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.34,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como isso funciona na prática?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:01.54,Leg,,0,0,0,,Eu vou botar aqui pra rodar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra você entender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:03.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,5 segundos pra você ter atenção.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,Começou!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.28,Leg,,0,0,0,,Ficou no verdinho,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:06.38,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai pedalar daquele jeito,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:07.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,acelerado,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você conseguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:09.13,Leg,,0,0,0,,No descansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:10.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,você não vai descansar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai pedalar devagar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,como foi mostrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:13.62,Leg,,0,0,0,,Acabou de descansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,você volta a pedalar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:15.55,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você conseguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:16.55,Leg,,0,0,0,,E assim por diante.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.40,Leg,,0,0,0,,Repara aqui em cima
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.52,Leg,,0,0,0,,que o treino tem somente
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:19.12,Leg,,0,0,0,,4 minutos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:20.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,Mas vai ser os 4 minutos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.37,Leg,,0,0,0,,mais intensos da sua vida.
